Hanumān begs rescue past deadline fearing Sugrīva --- Svayamprabhā bids shut eyes and lifts monkeys instantly --- Svayamprabhā shows Vindhya Prasravaṇa ocean and departs --- Monkeys face roaring ocean realizing month expired --- Monkeys see spring blossoms and collapse despairing --- Aṅgada Rāma-crowned fears Sugrīva wrath and vows seashore fast --- Tāra offers safe Māyā cave with food and no fear --- Monkeys agree seeking escape from killing
